§§ `s 52: non-economic loss (seat)`
-- Negligence, 1 June 2010, scale 25: 2003 amount 34 500 + 5 x 3 450 = 51 750; x 123.4/100 = 63 859.50; nearest $10: 63 860.
-- Prescribed minimum for 2010 with CPI 130/100: 2 750 x 1.3 = 3 575; nearest $10 (half up): 3 580.

