§§ `s 53: mental harm`

#ASSERT `Can I get damages for mental harm` `negligence` (`the date` 1 6 2015) FALSE TRUE `pure mental harm` TRUE EQUALS `s 53 does not bar damages for this mental harm`
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for mental harm` `negligence` (`the date` 1 6 2015) FALSE FALSE `pure mental harm` TRUE EQUALS `no: you were not physically injured in the accident or present at the scene when it happened, and are not a parent, spouse, domestic partner or child of a person killed, injured or endangered in it (s 53(1))`
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for mental harm` `MVA` (`the date` 1 6 2015) TRUE FALSE `pure mental harm` FALSE EQUALS `no: damages for pure mental harm need a recognised psychiatric illness (s 53(2))`
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for mental harm` `MVA` (`the date` 1 6 2015) TRUE FALSE `consequential mental harm` FALSE EQUALS `s 53 does not bar damages for this mental harm, but none may be awarded for economic loss resulting from it, because it is not a recognised psychiatric illness (s 53(3))`
#ASSERT `Can I get damages for mental harm` `other way` (`the date` 1 6 2015) TRUE FALSE `pure mental harm` TRUE EQUALS `not covered: Part 8 does not apply to how the injury arose (s 51)`

